	"Name": "(CP) MoreMoss Monsters",
	"Author": "Safty112",
	"Description": "I couldn't find a mod that added moss as a monster drop so I made a basic Content Patcher mod to add it as a drop. You will need the latest version (2.8.1) of Content Patcher for this mod to work.\n<br />\n<br />Theis mod supports\u00A0[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/5098]Generic Mod Config Menu (GMCM)[/url]\u00A0to edit the ability and chance of each monster in game to drop moss. If you don't have GMCM you can edit the config file manually. For simplicity options are provided for 1%, and 10% and then increasing by 10% until 100% for all monsters, with slimes being enabled at 10% by default. [i]If you don't know all the monsters/locations then this mod does have spoilers.[/i]\uFEFF\n<br />\n<br />This mod works well with my other mod [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/39631]MoreMoss Chopping[/url], which adds moss as a drop from tree chopping.",
